WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.075
What is the untold

00:00:01.087 --> 00:00:02.475
secret behind the mastery

00:00:02.487 --> 00:00:03.812
of Inside the nanoscale

00:00:03.825 --> 00:00:05.412
fabrication of semiconductor

00:00:05.425 --> 00:00:06.012
wafers

00:00:06.988 --> 00:00:08.625
Every masterpiece begins with

00:00:08.638 --> 00:00:10.012
meticulous preparation and

00:00:10.025 --> 00:00:11.450
precision engineered down to

00:00:11.463 --> 00:00:12.163
the millimeter

00:00:13.132 --> 00:00:14.506
Each cut requires steady

00:00:14.519 --> 00:00:15.994
hands and immense patience

00:00:16.219 --> 00:00:16.994
where even a tiny

00:00:17.007 --> 00:00:18.669
mistake cannot be tolerated

00:00:19.636 --> 00:00:20.598
And when every joint

00:00:20.611 --> 00:00:22.373
fits together seamlessly it

00:00:22.386 --> 00:00:23.585
reveals a timeless work

00:00:23.598 --> 00:00:24.760
of art crafted without

00:00:24.773 --> 00:00:25.673
a single nail

00:00:26.644 --> 00:00:27.556
That is the pure

00:00:27.569 --> 00:00:29.118
essence of true dedication

00:00:29.981 --> 00:00:31.006
Which detail of this

00:00:31.019 --> 00:00:32.181
process surprised you the

00:00:32.194 --> 00:00:32.694
most

